    <!-- Play Store listing (keep escaping AAPT-safe: no raw apostrophes, use \\n for breaks) -->
    <string name="store_short_description">On-device spyware checks, privacy VPN shield, and MASVS compliance scoring.</string>
    <string name="store_full_description">CoreGuard is an on-device Android security toolkit for people who want clear, honest visibility into device risk — journalists, activists, and privacy-conscious users.\n\nGUARDIAN SCORE\nA 0–100 score from local heuristic checks: debugger/root/emulator signals, build integrity, spyware package indicators, and signing-certificate verification when configured.\n\nNEMESIS SCANNER\nCompares installed packages and local indicators against open threat-intelligence lists sourced from the Amnesty International Security Lab / mvt-project. A clean result is reassuring but not a guarantee.\n\nPRIVACY SHIELD\nAn optional on-device VPN that filters DNS against known surveillance/tracker domains. Traffic is not routed through CoreGuard servers.\n\nMASVS COMPLIANCE\nSee how local checks map to OWASP MASVS v2 categories. Premium unlocks JSON report export for your own records or security team.\n\nWHAT WE DON\'T DO:\n- We don\'t collect personal data\n- We don\'t upload scan results to a CoreGuard cloud\n- We don\'t show ads\n- We don\'t track you across apps\n\nOptional anonymous HTTPS fetches may pull public IOC signature feeds. Source code is available on GitHub.\n\nCoreGuard is an independent project and is not affiliated with Amnesty International.</string>

